# Environment variables (Never commit secrets!)
# The trailing * matters: `.env*.local` alone does not match backup copies such
# as `.env.local.bak-1787084941`, which is how one got committed. `.env.example`
# is still tracked — these patterns all require `.local` in the name.
.env*.local
.env*.local.*
.env*.local-*

# TypeScript incremental compilation cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/admin/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Debug logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

